 r←Test_Menubar_004(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;TheForm;rf;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "Create" method with multiple status bar fields.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Menubar.CreateParms
 'TheForm'⎕WC'Form'('Coord' 'Pixel')('Posn'(35 45))('Size'(300 400))
 'SB'TheForm.⎕WC'Statusbar'
 'F1'TheForm.SB.⎕WC'StatusField'('Coord' 'Prop')('Size'(⍬ 49))
 rf←⍎'F2'TheForm.SB.⎕WC'StatusField'('Coord' 'Prop')('Size'(⍬ 48))
 'TheForm'⎕WS'Hintobj'TheForm.SB.F2
 parms.statusbar←rf
 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Menubar.Create TheForm MenuSample parms(⎕NEW #._APLGUI.GUI.KeyCodes)


 r←∆OK
